---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHeader from '../../components/PageHeader.astro';
import YouTubeEmbed from '../../components/YouTubeEmbed.astro';
import { url } from '../../lib/url';

const featuredAudiobooks = [
  {
    title: 'The Gospel Comes with a House Key (2018)',
    subtitle: 'Practicing Radically Ordinary Hospitality in Our Post-Christian World',
    byline: 'by Rosaria Butterfield, read by Rosaria Butterfield',
    image: '/images/resources/hoopla/gospel-house-key.webp',
    description:
      'What did God use to draw a radical, committed unbeliever to himself? Did God take her to an evangelistic rally? Or, since she had her doctorate in literature, did he use something in print? No, God used an invitation to dinner in a modest home, from a humble couple who lived out the gospel daily, simply, and authentically. With this story of her conversion as a backdrop, Rosaria Butterfield invites us into her home to show us how God can use this same "radical, ordinary hospitality" to bring the gospel to our lost friends and neighbors. Such hospitality sees our homes as not our own, but as God\'s tools for the furtherance of his kingdom as we welcome those who look, think, believe, and act differently from us into our everyday, sometimes messy lives—helping them see what true Christian faith really looks like.',
    href: 'https://www.hoopladigital.com/audiobook/the-gospel-comes-with-a-house-key-rosaria-butterfield/12059760',
  },
  {
    title: 'The Search for Significance (2012)',
    subtitle: "Seeing Your True Worth Through God's Eyes",
    byline: 'by Robert McGee, read by Mike Flynn',
    image: '/images/resources/hoopla/search-for-significance.webp',
    description:
      'Robert McGee\'s best-selling book has helped millions of readers learn how to be free to enjoy Christ\'s love while no longer basing their self-worth on their accomplishments or the opinions of others. In fact, Billy Graham said that it was a book that "should be read by every Christian." In this re-launch of this timeless classic you will: gain new skills for getting off the performance treadmill, discover how four false beliefs have negatively impacted your life, learn how to overcome obstacles that prevent you from experiencing the truth that your self-worth is found only in the love, acceptance, and forgiveness of Christ, and discover what two million readers have already discovered: that true significance is found only in Christ.',
    href: 'https://www.hoopladigital.com/audiobook/the-search-for-significance-robert-mcgee/11698740',
  },
  {
    title: 'Crazy Love, Revised and Updated (2013)',
    subtitle: 'Overwhelmed by a Relentless God',
    byline: 'by Francis Chan, read by Francis Chan',
    image: '/images/resources/hoopla/crazy-love.webp',
    description:
      'Have you ever wondered if we\'re missing it? It\'s crazy, if you think about it. The God of the universe—the Creator of nitrogen and pine needles, galaxies and E-minor—loves us with a radical, unconditional, self-sacrificing love. And what is our typical response? We go to church, sing songs, and try not to cuss. Whether you\'ve verbalized it yet or not, we all know something\'s wrong. Does something deep inside your heart long to break free from the status quo? Are you hungry for an authentic faith that addresses the problems of our world with tangible, even radical, solutions? God is calling you to a passionate love relationship with Himself. Because the answer to religious complacency isn\'t working harder at a list of dos and don\'ts—it\'s falling in love with God. And once you encounter His love, as Francis describes it, you will never be the same. Because when you\'re wildly in love with someone, it changes everything.',
    href: 'https://www.hoopladigital.com/audiobook/crazy-love,-revised-and-updated-francis-chan/11030821',
  },
  {
    title: 'Mere Christianity (2014)',
    subtitle: '',
    byline: 'by C. S. Lewis, read by Julian Rhind-Tutt',
    image: '/images/resources/hoopla/mere-christianity.webp',
    description:
      'One of the most popular and beloved introductions to the concept of faith ever written, Mere Christianity has sold millions of copies worldwide. The book brings together C. S. Lewis\'s legendary radio broadcasts during the war years, in which he set out simply to "explain and defend the belief that has been common to nearly all Christians at all times." Rejecting the boundaries that divide Christianity\'s many denominations, Mere Christianity provides an unequalled opportunity for believers and nonbelievers alike to absorb a powerful, rational case for the Christian faith.',
    href: 'https://www.hoopladigital.com/audiobook/mere-christianity-c-s-lewis/11589118',
  },
  {
    title: '7 Traits of Effective Parenting (2020)',
    subtitle: '',
    byline: 'by Danny Huerta, read by Mike Chamberlain',
    image: '/images/resources/hoopla/7-traits-parenting.webp',
    description:
      'In today\'s complex world, parenting is a tough job. Beyond the difficulties of the changing world we live in, there are also the daily frictions of imperfect people sharing a home together. However, Daniel P. Huerta, Focus on the Family\'s Vice President of Parenting, offers hope and help for you to become an effective parent. Based on exhaustive research, Huerta presents a collection of seven powerful character traits designed to help parents grow and thrive as they take on the task of raising children. Parents will be encouraged to navigate family life with grace and love so their children ultimately see God\'s transformative power, love, and influence.',
    href: 'https://www.hoopladigital.com/audiobook/7-traits-of-effective-parenting-danny-huerta/13340520',
  },
];

const bookshelf = [
  { title: 'Necessary Endings', author: 'Henry Cloud', image: '/images/resources/hoopla/necessary-endings.webp', href: 'https://www.hoopladigital.com/audiobook/necessary-endings-henry-cloud/11586511' },
  { title: 'Companions in Suffering', author: 'Wendy Alsup', image: '/images/resources/hoopla/companions-in-suffering.webp', href: 'https://www.hoopladigital.com/audiobook/companions-in-suffering-wendy-alsup/13020695' },
  { title: 'You and Me Forever', author: 'Francis & Lisa Chan', image: '/images/resources/hoopla/you-and-me-forever.webp', href: 'https://www.hoopladigital.com/audiobook/you-and-me-forever-francis-and-lisa-chan/11498751' },
  { title: 'The Search for Significance', author: 'Robert McGee', image: '/images/resources/hoopla/search-for-significance.webp', href: 'https://www.hoopladigital.com/audiobook/the-search-for-significance-robert-mcgee/11698740' },
  { title: "Why Do I Do What I Don't Want to Do?", author: 'Jonathan "JP" Pokluda', image: '/images/resources/hoopla/why-do-i-do.webp', href: 'https://www.hoopladigital.com/audiobook/why-do-i-do-what-i-dont-want-to-do-jonathan-jp-pokluda/15639100' },
  { title: 'Healing Racial Trauma', author: 'Sheila Wise Rowe', image: '/images/resources/hoopla/healing-racial-trauma.webp', href: 'https://www.hoopladigital.com/audiobook/healing-racial-trauma-sheila-wise-rowe/12667356' },
  { title: 'Culture Shock', author: 'Chip Ingram', image: '/images/resources/hoopla/culture-shock.webp', href: 'https://www.hoopladigital.com/audiobook/culture-shock-chip-ingram/11498527' },
  { title: 'God Came Near', author: 'Max Lucado', image: '/images/resources/hoopla/god-came-near.webp', href: 'https://www.hoopladigital.com/audiobook/god-came-near-max-lucado/11618072' },
  { title: 'The Real God', author: 'Chip Ingram', image: '/images/resources/hoopla/the-real-god.webp', href: 'https://www.hoopladigital.com/audiobook/the-real-god-chip-ingram/11645043' },
  { title: 'Rediscover Church', author: 'Collin Hansen', image: '/images/resources/hoopla/rediscover-church.webp', href: 'https://www.hoopladigital.com/audiobook/rediscover-church-collin-hansen/15013665' },
  { title: 'God of All Things', author: 'Andrew Wilson', image: '/images/resources/hoopla/god-of-all-things.webp', href: 'https://www.hoopladigital.com/audiobook/god-of-all-things-andrew-wilson/13942208' },
  { title: 'How Not to Save the World', author: 'Hosanna Wong', image: '/images/resources/hoopla/how-not-to-save-the-world.webp', href: 'https://www.hoopladigital.com/audiobook/how-not-to-save-the-world-hosanna-wong/13775191' },
  { title: 'Gospel Fluency', author: 'Jeff Vanderstelt', image: '/images/resources/hoopla/gospel-fluency.webp', href: 'https://www.hoopladigital.com/audiobook/gospel-fluency-jeff-vanderstelt/11698999' },
  { title: 'The Pursuit of God', author: 'A. W. Tozer', image: '/images/resources/hoopla/pursuit-of-god.webp', href: 'https://www.hoopladigital.com/audiobook/the-pursuit-of-god-a-w-tozer/13082783' },
  { title: "Don't Waste Your Life", author: 'John Piper', image: '/images/resources/hoopla/dont-waste-your-life.webp', href: 'https://www.hoopladigital.com/audiobook/dont-waste-your-life-john-piper/16317929' },
  { title: '7 Traits of Effective Parenting', author: 'Danny Huerta', image: '/images/resources/hoopla/7-traits-parenting.webp', href: 'https://www.hoopladigital.com/audiobook/7-traits-of-effective-parenting-danny-huerta/13340520' },
];
---

<BaseLayout title="Audiobooks on Hoopla" description="Free Christian audiobooks through your public library on Hoopla Digital.">
  <PageHeader
    title="Audiobooks on Hoopla"
    eyebrow="Reading & Listening"
    subtitle="Borrow and stream Christian audiobooks, eBooks, and more for free using your local public library card."
    breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'Resources', href: '/resources' }, { label: 'Audiobooks on Hoopla' }]}
  />

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-4 py-14 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-16">
    <!-- What is Hoopla + Tutorial -->
    <div class="grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:items-center">
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 space-y-4">
        <p class="font-mono text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent-hover">Getting Started</p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900">What is hoopla?</h2>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-stone-700">
          <a href="https://www.hoopladigital.com/help" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="font-semibold text-accent-hover underline">hoopla Digital</a> partners with libraries across the United States, Canada, Australia, and New Zealand to provide online and mobile access to eBooks, audiobooks, comics, music, movies, and TV. With hoopla and a valid library card, patrons can borrow, stream, and download dynamic content via hoopla’s mobile app or <strong>www.hoopladigital.com</strong>.
        </p>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-stone-600">
          While our church is unaffiliated with hoopla or libraries, we highlight these valuable resources for your spiritual growth! Watch this YouTube video from the San Francisco Public Library to learn how to sign up and use hoopla on your phone.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="lg:col-span-6">
        <YouTubeEmbed youtubeId="fE5CGNQGaYo" title="How to Use Hoopla on Your Phone" speaker="San Francisco Public Library" />
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Recommended Audiobooks -->
    <div>
      <p class="font-mono text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent-hover">Free With a Library Card</p>
      <h2 class="mt-1 font-display text-2xl font-extrabold text-stone-900 sm:text-3xl">Recommended Audiobooks</h2>
      <div class="mt-6 divide-y divide-stone-300 border-y border-stone-300">
        {featuredAudiobooks.map((b, idx) => (
          <article class="grid gap-6 py-8 md:grid-cols-12 md:items-start">
            <div class="md:col-span-3 flex items-start gap-4 md:block">
              <a
                href={b.href}
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
                class="block w-28 sm:w-36 md:w-44 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-stone-300 bg-white transition-transform hover:-translate-y-0.5"
              >
                <img
                  src={url(b.image)}
                  alt={`${b.title} audiobook cover`}
                  loading={idx < 2 ? 'eager' : 'lazy'}
                  decoding={idx < 2 ? 'sync' : 'async'}
                  class="aspect-square w-full object-cover"
                />
              </a>
            </div>
            <div class="md:col-span-9 space-y-3">
              <p class="font-mono text-xs font-medium text-accent-hover">0{idx + 1}</p>
              <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-stone-900">
                <a href={b.href} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-accent-hover transition-colors">
                  {b.title}
                </a>
              </h3>
              {b.subtitle && <p class="text-sm font-medium italic text-stone-700">{b.subtitle}</p>}
              <p class="font-mono text-xs text-stone-500">{b.byline}</p>
              <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-stone-700">{b.description}</p>
              <div class="pt-1">
                <a
                  href={b.href}
                  target="_blank"
                  rel="noopener noreferrer"
                  class="inline-flex items-center rounded-lg border border-stone-300 bg-white px-4 py-2 font-mono text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-900 hover:border-stone-900 hover:text-accent-hover transition-colors"
                >
                  Available on Hoopla &nearr;
                </a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- From Our Bookshelf -->
    <div>
      <p class="font-mono text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent-hover">Curated Picks</p>
      <h2 class="mt-1 font-display text-2xl font-extrabold text-stone-900">From Our Bookshelf</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-stone-600">Additional Christian audiobooks available on hoopla Digital with a public library card.</p>
      <div class="mt-6 grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-4">
        {bookshelf.map((book) => (
          <a
            href={book.href}
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="group flex flex-col justify-between overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-stone-300 bg-white transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-stone-900"
          >
            <div>
              <div class="aspect-square w-full overflow-hidden bg-stone-100 border-b border-stone-200">
                <img
                  src={url(book.image)}
                  alt={`${book.title} cover`}
                  loading="lazy"
                  decoding="async"
                  class="h-full w-full object-cover transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-105"
                />
              </div>
              <div class="p-4 pb-2">
                <h3 class="font-display text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 group-hover:text-accent-hover transition-colors">
                  {book.title}
                </h3>
                <p class="mt-1 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-500">{book.author}</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <p class="px-4 pb-4 pt-2 font-mono text-[11px] font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-accent-hover">
              Listen &nearr;
            </p>
          </a>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
